codex
The root cause is confirmed: the sandbox’s PID namespace and mounted `/proc` disagree, so `/proc/<getpid()>/exe` is absent while `/proc/self/exe` works. Lean’s Linux runtime uses the numeric form. I’m adding a narrowly scoped temporary preload shim that redirects only `/proc/<digits>/exe` readlinks to `/proc/self/exe`; its source, compiler command, and hash will be recorded.
apply patch
